---
import Header from "@/components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "@/components/Footer.astro";
import WhatsAppCTA from "@/components/WhatsAppCTA.astro";
import Seo from "@/components/Seo.astro";
import "@/styles/global.css";

interface Props {
  title: string;
  description: string;
  path: string;
  image?: string;
  type?: "website" | "article";
  noHeaderCta?: boolean;
}

const { title, description, path, image, type } = Astro.props;
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="es-CO">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#fbfaf6" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
    <link rel="sitemap" href="/sitemap-index.xml" />
    <Seo title={title} description={description} path={path} image={image} type={type} />
    <slot name="head" />
    <script is:inline>
      document.documentElement.classList.add("js-reveal-ready");
    </script>
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-dvh antialiased">
    <!--
      THESIS: hiring Dra. Daniela Jaramillo is a high-level decision — the
      site presents as a private legal maison for a woman at the top of her
      field: light-filled and luminous, not moody or dark. Refuses both the
      grafito-institutional register this site shipped with before and a
      black-dominant "dark luxury" register the client also rejected outright.
      OWN-WORLD: marfil (ivory, #EDE8E1 family) as the dominant ground on
      every section — no full dark sections anywhere on the site. Negro
      (ink-950, #0F0F10) reserved to text and fine detail (borders, the
      wordmark, body copy) exactly as the client's own brand board labels
      it: "negro profundo → principal/texto", "beige claro → fondos". Oro
      (#C9A96A family) as material — hairline rules, borders, and the
      primary button fill. Playfair Display for the wordmark and every
      heading, Montserrat tracked uppercase for UI, labels, and real data.
      Black-on-gold and gold-on-cream are the highest-contrast pairs, used
      deliberately for the primary CTA.
      STORY: a visitor who is scared and deciding fast understands within
      seconds that this is an elite, expensive defense — light, warm,
      confident, not intimidating — and that the asymmetry (eight years
      building the Fiscalía's cases, now dismantling them) is exactly why
      it costs what it costs; books a consultation.
      FIRST VIEWPORT: full-bleed marfil hero, wordmark "Dra. Daniela
      Jaramillo" in large Playfair Display in near-black, a gold hairline
      rule above it, the real studio portrait at large scale matted in a
      thin gold-bordered ivory frame, gold-filled primary CTA beside a
      gold-outline WhatsApp CTA.
      FORM: brief-pinned by the client (exact palette, Playfair Display +
      Montserrat, sharoncastilloabogados.com as a craft-level reference,
      explicit "no DJ monogram" wordmark instruction) — concept-seed run
      acknowledged (seed key a7bf7aa9, mode persuade); a user-pinned
      direction overrides the roll per the skill's own rule.
      REVISION: a first pass at this brief inverted the client's own brand
      board — it made negro the dominant background and marfil the
      secondary reading surface, when the board explicitly assigns negro to
      "texto" and beige to "fondos." The client rejected it immediately and
      explicitly: no black, she is a woman, use the light colors. This
      revision corrects that misreading — literally, not just stylistically
      — by making marfil the ground everywhere and negro text-and-detail
      only. Product truth, copy, palette values, typefaces, and the display
      name (Dra. Daniela Jaramillo) are unchanged from the prior pass; only
      which color plays which role changed.
      FINISH: unreviewed and undocumented is unfinished; this build ends
      with the finish review, the verdict, and DESIGN.md.
    -->
    <a
      href="#contenido"
      class="sr-only focus:not-sr-only focus:fixed focus:left-4 focus:top-4 focus:z-[100] focus:rounded-sm focus:bg-manila-50 focus:px-4 focus:py-2 focus:text-ink-950"
    >
      Saltar al contenido
    </a>
    <Header />
    <main id="contenido">
      <slot />
    </main>
    <Footer />
    <WhatsAppCTA />
    <script>
      // Entrada única al cargar, nunca condicionada al scroll: el contenido
      // no puede depender de que el usuario llegue a hacer scroll para
      // volverse visible (robots, lectores, o un fallo de JS no deben dejar
      // secciones enteras invisibles).
      requestAnimationFrame(() => {
        requestAnimationFrame(() => {
          document.querySelectorAll("[data-reveal]").forEach((el) => el.classList.add("is-visible"));
        });
      });
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
